---
// Quiz figure for the Go concurrency quiz (post 13), set 08: the two goroutines of etcd-io/etcd#11817
// (Restore and a compaction worker), what each holds and what each is waiting on.
// It states the situation only. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
const left = ['holds s.mu', 'closed s.stopc', 'waits in s.fifoSched.Stop()'];
const right = ['running compactBarrier', 'calls s.mu.Lock()', 'reads s.stopc after that'];
---
<div class="qfig-gq13lc">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 230" role="img" aria-label="Two goroutines. Restore holds s.mu, has closed s.stopc and waits in s.fifoSched.Stop. A compaction worker is running compactBarrier, calls s.mu.Lock and reads s.stopc after that.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq13lc-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two goroutines in the mvcc store</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai goroutine trong mvcc store</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="14" y="52" class="qfig-gq13lc-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Restore goroutine</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Goroutine Restore</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="324" y="52" class="qfig-gq13lc-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Compaction worker</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Worker compaction</tspan>
    </text>
    {left.map((t, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x="14" y={64 + i * 44} width="244" height="34" rx="6" class="qfig-gq13lc-box" />
        <text x="26" y={86 + i * 44} class="qfig-gq13lc-c">{t}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    {right.map((t, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x="324" y={64 + i * 44} width="244" height="34" rx="6" class="qfig-gq13lc-box" />
        <text x="336" y={86 + i * 44} class="qfig-gq13lc-c">{t}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1="258" x2="318" y1="149" y2="149" class="qfig-gq13lc-arrow" />
    <polygon points="324,149 314,144 314,154" class="qfig-gq13lc-head" />
    <text x="291" y="140" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq13lc-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>waits for</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>chờ</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="324" x2="264" y1="105" y2="105" class="qfig-gq13lc-arrow" />
    <polygon points="258,105 268,100 268,110" class="qfig-gq13lc-head" />
    <text x="291" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq13lc-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>waits for</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>chờ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="0" y="214" class="qfig-gq13lc-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Top arrow: worker, waiting for the lock Restore holds. Bottom arrow: Restore, waiting for the worker.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mũi tên trên: worker chờ khóa mà Restore giữ. Mũi tên dưới: Restore chờ worker.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq13lc { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq13lc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq13lc text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq13lc .qfig-gq13lc-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq13lc .qfig-gq13lc-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq13lc .qfig-gq13lc-c { font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace); fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq13lc-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq13lc-arrow { stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 2; }
  .qfig-gq13lc-head { fill: var(--act-2); }
</style>
